# Jak 1, 0.1.8 (LIST-0.1.8 item 15, a player at Geyser Rock: "it tells me to double jump to get up on ledge. Well I'm
# definitely double jumping but still can't quite make it up there"). Run with JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=training-start
# JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1, once with the sim's game rate (the headset's, gkcfg) and once at sixty (gkcfg-60, as the game
